  "description": "Every provider request shape, byte-exact. APNs headers are listed in order; FCM bodies are POSTed to {fcm.base_url}/v1/projects/{project}/messages:send. Cases with device_secret_key decrypt to plaintext. inputs.collapse_key is the producer's collapse_key, which the gateway keeps to itself: pushes carry inputs.collapse_id, derived from it with collapse_secret. Topics with collapse = \"topic\" (every peer topic) pass none, so their background and FCM v1 pushes carry no collapse id.",
